    10.70.70.1   (SUBJECT-B)  : 5 sent, **0 echo replies**   (5/5 in step 4)
    10.90.90.1   (SUBJECT-A)  : 5 sent, **5 echo replies**   <- LIVE POSITIVE CONTROL, same capture
    203.0.113.9  (CONTROL)    : 5 sent, 0 echo replies
    192.168.10.1 (INSTRUMENT) : 5 sent, 5 echo replies
  Note there is NOT ONE frame of 10.70.70.1 traffic in the capture other than our five requests
